  "description": "Mod based on the Italian region FVG",
  "body": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n# Friul-Craft\n\n### Mod based on the Italian region Friuli Venezia Giulia\n\n</div>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/239cc6b112df30d84f8501fd452bafa37adc7486.png\" \n     align=\"right\" \n     width=\"200\"/>\n\nExplore the culture of FVG inside Minecraft!\n\n- Like Wine/Vineyards\n- Frico\n- And a lot of new features\n- Oh! I almost forgot, you can get drunk in this mod\n\nSo don't overdo it, please.\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/67917cee7e439311e72b95554a3fe42a5235f77f.png\" width=\"75%\">\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    &nbsp\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n## Features\n\n</div>\n\nCool new effects\n\n- UMAMI - Gives the player the ability to eat even if the food bar is full. Bousts saturation to the limit\n- DRUNK - Like i said erlier you don't want to drink to much... please\n\nNew Blocks - Decorations - Items - Advancements - Paintings - Mobs Variants - And more\n\n<img align=\"left\" width=\"10%\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7e597f74363d9bcfa3dca1670d50c52736363e3e.png\"/>\n\n<img align=\"right\" width=\"10%\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8dbead8990eaf9cde14fe1aaff8fd86800868479.png\"/>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<div style=\"height: 40px; clear: both;\"></div>\n\n<div align=\"right\">\n  &nbsp\n</div>\n<div>\n  &nbsp\n</div>\n<div>\n  &nbsp\n</div>\n<div>\n  &nbsp\n</div>\n<div>\n  &nbsp\n</div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n## Gallery\n\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n  ### Frico\n\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4e0130f07c26c1cbd9eec0d1b7452b3d16389fa0.png\"\n       width=\"25%\"\n     align=\"left\"/>\n\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8358a3abbd17545366c4dcdd3b1ea9142158ea90.png\"\n       width=\"65%\" style=\"margin: 10px;\"\n     align=\"center\"/>\n\n### Wine\n\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/59f62ef057b068db50c5eb0eb8195dd18d4d3358.png\"\n       width=\"65%\" style=\"margin: 10px;\"\n     align=\"center\"/>\n\n### Drunk Effect\n\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/19e3cdb96e01403bb675038e0d94ef9eb81db75f.png\"\n       width=\"65%\" style=\"margin: 10px;\"\n     align=\"center\"/>\n\n### Winemaker House\n\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c63e0425a1496b31315b8cc48b96eb58f3d6307b.png\"\n       width=\"65%\" style=\"margin: 10px;\"\n     align=\"center\"/>\n  \n### Vine Plants\n\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b290502a2e3abc722a69e8f669fbed3981119afc.png\"\n       width=\"65%\" style=\"margin: 10px;\"\n     align=\"center\"/>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n<img\n  src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ec0f991a21334bb3c3f010d72d962e545e6fd44b.png\"\n  width=\"40%\"\n  align=\"right\"\n/>\n\n<div align=\"center\" margin: 200%>\n\n## Mandi Mandi and thanks for the download\n\n</div>\n\nCheck my youtube\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Nargi_\" target=\"_blank\">\n\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e145ca8f6a3f162bcfc16c07de0dca60a6650d01.png\"\n       width=\"15%\" style=\"margin: 10px;\"\n     align=\"center\"/>\n\n</a>\n  \n\n  \n",
